- <script> tags (except those with safe types like text/template)
- Event handler attributes (onclick, onload, etc.)
- javascript: and vbscript: URLs in any attribute
- CSS expressions and javascript: URLs within <style> tags
- meta refresh with javascript:
- allowscriptaccess attribute

